(CASH CONTROL NOTES) Tj
T*
(The servicing team records collection dates and asset references before sending the cash) Tj
T*
(file to the trustee. A buyer's promise to pay may be attached as a forecast, but must) Tj
T*
(remain outside the distributable cash total. Reconciliation matches the bank statement to) Tj
T*
(the file and explains outstanding items. Forecasts are useful for the next period's) Tj
T*
(planning; they cannot fund the present distribution. Tax escrow belongs in its own ledger) Tj
T*
(so an invoice paid from escrow does not appear again as an unrestricted cash expense.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(APPENDIX E | TRUSTEE FEE REQUEST REVIEW) Tj
T*
(The trustee's request is reconciled to the service period and supporting fee notice before) Tj
T*
(being placed in the first waterfall step. A request can be larger than the amount permitted) Tj
T*
(at that step. The reviewer preserves the requested amount as a source fact while showing) Tj
T*
(the permitted application separately. Editing the request to equal the permitted) Tj
T*
(application would make the audit trail look simpler but would conceal the reason a) Tj
T*
(difference existed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Staff do not relabel the unallocated part of a fee request as senior interest. The two) Tj
T*
(obligations have different sources and positions in the memorandum. A fee invoice cannot) Tj
T*
(become an interest arrears record just by moving its amount to another worksheet row. Any) Tj
T*
(unresolved treatment of a requested fee remains explicitly unresolved rather than being) Tj
T*
(pushed into an unrelated class to produce a fully paid report.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The signed notice identifies the fee actually applied in the distribution and the) Tj
T*
(supporting cap. A later correction to the source invoice is handled with its own record.) Tj
T*
(The correction does not retroactively authorize a draft allocation that was inconsistent) Tj
T*
(with the main waterfall. The casebook keeps invoice administration distinct from the) Tj
T*
(distribution priority so staff can discuss an invoice without silently changing the cash) Tj
T*
(rules for senior, reserve or junior payments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
