(APPENDIX O | EXTERNAL AUDIT WORKING PACK) Tj
T*
(The audit working pack provides the selected period's source cash reconciliation,) Tj
T*
(obligation registers, reserve history, trigger observations, signed worksheet, notice and) Tj
T*
(execution evidence. It is a collection of records for review, not a new instruction to) Tj
T*
(operate trust accounts. Audit comments are logged as findings or questions, with the) Tj
T*
(responsible record owner identified for a response.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The pack distinguishes a missing document from a document that exists but does not support) Tj
T*
(the claimed conclusion. An unsigned draft might explain how an analyst worked without) Tj
T*
(proving that the final decision was authorized. A report repeating the worksheet total is) Tj
T*
(not independent evidence of its inputs. Reviewers trace material claims back to the) Tj
T*
(underlying record instead of counting the number of documents that repeat the same figure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sensitive or unrelated asset details can be handled through the authorized audit process) Tj
T*
(without inventing identities in this fictional casebook. An extract should preserve) Tj
T*
(qualifications that affect interpretation and clearly state that it is an extract. The full) Tj
T*
(controlled record remains the reference for a disputed context. Audit convenience does not) Tj
T*
(permit staff to omit a reserve restriction or trigger qualification from the evidence) Tj
T*
(supplied for a distribution conclusion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(APPENDIX P | CLOSE OF PERIOD AND HANDOVER) Tj
T*
(After execution, the closing reconciliation accounts for actual payments, actual reserve) Tj
T*
(movements and the unrestricted cash retained. Outstanding instructions are listed) Tj
T*
(separately from completed movements. The next team's opening file should make it possible) Tj
T*
(to distinguish cash carried forward from new collections and to identify any failed payment) Tj
T*
(whose obligation still needs attention.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The handover note names unresolved issues and links their source records. It does not) Tj
T*
(create a power to settle them outside the main memorandum. A personal note that a manager) Tj
T*
(expected a cure next month remains a forecast, and a draft plan to sell equipment remains a) Tj
T*
(plan. Staff should not convert those expectations into current cash, a cleared trigger or) Tj
T*
(an authorized junior distribution merely to reduce the list of open items.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The completed period is archived with the edition, observation set and final worksheet) Tj
T*
(used. Later teams can learn from mistakes without rewriting the original chronology. If a) Tj
T*
(genuine subsequent event changes an outstanding balance, its effect is recorded in the) Tj
T*
(appropriate later reconciliation. The resulting chain explains both what was distributed) Tj
T*
(and what remained, preserving the distinction between current interest, arrears, capital,) Tj
T*
(reserve and unrestricted cash across the handover.) Tj
T*
() Tj
